#: ../../source/tutorials/index.md:23 28143c553cf1441e96aaa7695c8c3fb6
msgid ""
"VASP/ABACUS 示例的初始数据使用 ASE EMT，只用于跑通工作流机械过程。它不能与 正"
"式第一性原理标签混合作为生产训练集。蒸馏示例的小数据和短训练同样只用于验证 接"
"口。"
msgstr ""
"The VASP and ABACUS examples use ASE EMT data only to exercise workflow "
"mechanics. Do not mix those labels with production first-principles training "
"data. The small datasets and short training runs in the distillation "
"examples likewise validate interfaces only."
